      ],
      "source": "https://www.townofcourtland.org/history/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "One of the South’s earliest railroads, the Tuscumbia, Courtland and Decatur Railroad, was organized in Courtland in 1831.",
